%% alt: An eval loop: cases from real use, edge cases and must-refuse cases run through the system under test; graders (code, a model, or people) score the outputs; scores with error bars feed a release gate. Production traffic is sampled into the graders, and failures become new cases.
flowchart TB
  D[(Cases: real use, edge cases,<br/>must-refuse)]:::data --> S[System under test]:::model
  S --> G[Graders<br/>code, model, human]:::control --> R[Scores with<br/>error bars]:::data --> X{Release gate}:::control
  P[Production traffic]:::human -.->|sample| G
  G -.->|failures become cases| D
